BoxUtilities unit test
======================

This single-process test calls BoxUtilities::fixBadCutPointsForDirection()
with controlled cut lists and bad-cut masks, checking the exact resulting
cut lists.  Cases cover empty lists, unchanged cuts, lower and upper
replacements, removal of all cuts, iterator aliasing, and cut-factor
alignment with a rounded minimum size.

The test uses one MPI task in MPI-enabled builds and runs directly otherwise.
No input file is needed.
